{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>36歲前「八模兵團」𡃁模女神盧頌之（DaDa Lo），自從下嫁38歲大隻仔趙勁皓（King）並育有一子一女後，已漸漸淡出幕前專心相夫教子。不過這對夫妻私底下依然十分貪玩，日前DaDa在IG Story轉發友人拍攝的影片，疑似兩公婆投資了內地夜場，齊齊化身「老闆、老闆娘」在波波池下海狂歡，作風極度大膽！</p><figure><img alt=\"Dada Lo嫁俾大隻仔趙勁皓後，專心相夫教子。（IG@dadaloooo）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260208/1097208923355615232254976.png/A-9I2S07Kw2IgoJhtigqasbYX6dF8ZQDgmRjHYJkYx0\"/><figcaption>Dada Lo嫁俾大隻仔趙勁皓後，專心相夫教子。（IG@dadaloooo）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"二人育有一子一女。（IG@dadaloooo）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260823/1168283689541570560576314.jpeg/IxuQ3EMZryP_5TNnX1DREvshVOIfFZOKmc_bq5nP26s\"/><figcaption>二人育有一子一女。（IG@dadaloooo）</figcaption></figure><p>老闆King哥先下海　獲三點式索女貼胸夾攻</p><p>從片段可見，夜場內有強勁音樂，更設有一個大型波波池。有人用普通話開咪大叫「King哥」後，穿上白衫牛仔褲的King隨即走入波波池。隨後有三名穿著惹火泳衣的索女落池，King攤開雙手，任由性感女在其身上游走。三女越跳越辣，更起身貼近King的壯闊胸膛，惹來全場嘩聲四起！不過King哥尚算守規矩，雙手乖乖沒有亂摸，僅與其中一名索女咬耳仔，片中更配上字幕：「老闆都要下海」。</p><figure><img alt=\"King係老闆。（IG@dadaloooo）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260823/1168283861449183232784592.png/xg9ijX94_TnSq7fI1N1gJUrI4PDmipK89-g3XvfoN14\"/><figcaption>King係老闆。（IG@dadaloooo）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"走入波波池與辣妹共舞。（IG@dadaloooo）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260823/1168283864771203072605341.png/-r74RG3R7ogrLzC630U0lfLBWNwPvOdb3zbJ2N82ydg\"/><figcaption>走入波波池與辣妹共舞。（IG@dadaloooo）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"King都好守規矩。（IG@dadaloooo）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260823/1168283868013531136716480.png/77J1xIrwtFGnQlAMMmReOhDEJ-vDVHq2c3awbXN2sG0\"/><figcaption>King都好守規矩。（IG@dadaloooo）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"King企企完全唔郁。（IG@dadaloooo）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260823/1168284101380149248836259.png/Z4iRs1JVniUSR1ezDBj0-GK0sYrDDpDoFXz3jhV8944\"/><figcaption>King企企完全唔郁。（IG@dadaloooo）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"King企企完全唔郁。（IG@dadaloooo）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260823/1168284103989137408169374.png/uA7RXDoW9zRMrq0sKauZxFt1_5GlHkx0vX7h3L1-4dw\"/><figcaption>King企企完全唔郁。（IG@dadaloooo）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"King企企完全唔郁。（IG@dadaloooo）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260823/1168284106669428736820317.png/t91Fw3wqLxst-hAcYSaExJ6UVoXMx3rLgEYgH4BGIB8\"/><figcaption>King企企完全唔郁。（IG@dadaloooo）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"King企企完全唔郁。（IG@dadaloooo）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260823/1168284109068701696148963.png/vgNVgrSi1S_Afwd_Ycz9q27T5JZ6nBJxeh0lnHodJZw\"/><figcaption>King企企完全唔郁。（IG@dadaloooo）</figcaption></figure><p>老闆娘DaDa玩得更狂　遭紅褲猛男抱起雙腿夾實</p><p>另一條片就輪到DaDa出場，片中寫上「老闆娘都要」。穿上白衫營造「無下裝」大騷美腿的DaDa，一落波波池已經自High舉手狂跳。接著有三名僅穿紅色三角泳褲的壯男落場伴舞，男方先捉住DaDa的手摸自己的身體；隨後有人用普通話大叫：「抱起她！」其中一名壯男即時將DaDa成個抱起，DaDa順勢用雙腿夾實對方身體，猛力搖晃做出疑似不雅動作。雖然尺度極大，但DaDa全程玩得非常開心，毫不扭捏。</p><figure><img alt=\"Dada玩得比老公仲癲。（IG@dadaloooo）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260823/1168284271715028992978360.png/0JXoLF522CvBj8a9S5MHS7BH1xiUGtX1Kw-JEisPiRI\"/><figcaption>Dada玩得比老公仲癲。（IG@dadaloooo）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Dada被三赤裸猛男包圍。（IG@dadaloooo）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260823/1168284274399514624416593.png/WH1pL2pBimNdqcfw46YXjiaHK5YhcBFPUzommFM6Jpg\"/><figcaption>Dada被三赤裸猛男包圍。（IG@dadaloooo）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"被抱起疑做不雅動作。（IG@dadaloooo）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260823/1168284277180469248302785.png/OvNmULGPRYfIPalqXY8w35mv-NzGr0jt0WurL9Frqy8\"/><figcaption>被抱起疑做不雅動作。（IG@dadaloooo）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"玩到癲！（IG@dadaloooo）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260823/1168284435070586880038164.png/pXJBEkelMRYqWIiWWv19zKA0XzoFfxQAZvTbkmb025I\"/><figcaption>玩到癲！（IG@dadaloooo）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"玩到癲！（IG@dadaloooo）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260823/1168284438291943424297456.png/n4YAkw1v3SFdo1ahB2AN3cC7wZnYnqlW8BRV-PAUVfg\"/><figcaption>玩到癲！（IG@dadaloooo）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"玩到癲！（IG@dadaloooo）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260823/1168284440443752448907281.png/NfvCiw3G5T_pbNdHzRjN6LL4FGqU3Q86mQQTJpkEEyY\"/><figcaption>玩到癲！（IG@dadaloooo）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"玩到癲！（IG@dadaloooo）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260823/1168284443748995072395127.png/Z1l1iC6KqNxNKL8ZjJ7k7wPHCSg-NSg8KPZbDCj2Www\"/><figcaption>玩到癲！（IG@dadaloooo）</figcaption></figure><p>夫妻熱愛杯中物　曾醉軟坐輪椅兼傳婚變</p><p>DaDa與老公King年輕時都曾推出過性感寫真集，而且各有市場。二人向來熱愛夜生活及飲酒，DaDa早年曾發文投訴老公飲酒飲到入醫院；而今年初DaDa自己亦因飲到爛醉如泥、全身癱軟無力，要由友人用輪椅推走，被朋友發文笑指「有位院友走失咗」。</p><p>除了醉酒風波，兩人的婚姻亦曾現暗湧。2021年DaDa突然在IG發放負面文：「所有的離開都是有徵兆的，我見過你愛我的樣子，所以也知道你不愛我的樣子...」一度惹來婚變揣測。不過她隨後刪文並澄清「冇事」，如今見兩人齊齊在夜場狂歡，各有各玩，相信夫妻感情依然充滿情趣！</p><figure><img alt=\"美滿幸福。（IG@dadaloooo）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240731/895385312035999744649837.jpeg/NXpJRv3OMWcJv1JOcbC7R-6CqQkzUUrj7WM5Au1jOQI\"/><figcaption>美滿幸福。（IG@dadaloooo）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"盧頌之曾上載多張自己受到貓毛敏感以致臉部變形的照片，面目全非，相當嚇人。（IG@dadaloooo）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260208/1097209963379429376032786.jpeg/ZYIGUdrS-jgW4DP8VeNTc9kMVRrX327-bBamCGwWpgg\"/><figcaption>盧頌之曾上載多張自己受到貓毛敏感以致臉部變形的照片，面目全非，相當嚇人。（IG@dadaloooo）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"盧頌之曾上載多張自己受到貓毛敏感以致臉部變形的照片，面目全非，相當嚇人。（IG@dadaloooo）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260208/1097209965980028928524971.jpeg/O1D47IFb6hNeLRJ_NtxUpH9En-0SZUmQXqNhgl6jYYI\"/><figcaption>盧頌之曾上載多張自己受到貓毛敏感以致臉部變形的照片，面目全非，相當嚇人。（IG@dadaloooo）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"強調唔係AI。（IG@dadaloooo）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260208/1097209968593211392128093.jpeg/ftp3Wnpy6qsXbjZEe3JwTh-yuZeNE8OIL3OJCi9ziQo\"/><figcaption>強調唔係AI。（IG@dadaloooo）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"盧頌之被友人揭醜態，爛醉如泥！（IG@pomanchung）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260208/1097209142604730368254169.png/4lJ3Bh1xulzxlW9bLFvVQDcV0MlQqvWHxjOeucYznrk\"/><figcaption>盧頌之被友人揭醜態，爛醉如泥！（IG@pomanchung）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"完全失知覺咁款。（IG@pomanchung）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260208/1097209138066231296324697.png/XnZnasc7kIoHzHaUZN1jlTC8fRKPiA_U4T9UvuE_VL4\"/><figcaption>完全失知覺咁款。（IG@pomanchung）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-23T22:38:23.797085+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1445,"images":22,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none"}}